    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="1">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:VIIIAtr">VIII Atr</ref> 1</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Þæt is ærest, þæt he wile þæt ealle Godes circan beon fulles griðes wurðe.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">In the first place, it is his will that all the churches of God be entitled to exercise their right of protection to the full.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Ðæt is ærest, þæt he wile, þæt ealle Godes cyrican beon fulles griðes wyrðe.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
